<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/requirementUUID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The UUID used by a requirements management or any other lifecycle management tool to uniquely identify a requirement item. UUID, or universally unique ID, is a standard term in requirements engineering."@en .
